<title>USA: Valspar Corp completes Sureguard purchase.</title>
<headline>Valspar Corp completes Sureguard purchase.</headline>
<dateline>MINNEAPOLIS 1997-01-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Valspar Corp said Thursday it completed its acquisition of Sureguard Inc, a manufacturer of industrial coatings, for an undisclosed price.</p>
<p>Sureguard, which posted annual revenues of $10 million in 1996, is located in Grand Prairie, Texas.</p>
<p>Valspar makes paints and coatings.</p>
<p>It shares were trading down 1/8 Thursday at 57-1/8.</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk (312) 408-8787))</p>
